Error [E0120]: `a` is still used later, so filling this field would copy it
  --> copies_explicit_local_field.jet:11:21
    |
 11 |     b :: Holder{xs: a}
    |                     ^
 Why: `copies: .Explicit` is active, so a copy into an owned field must be written
 Fix: Copy it explicitly with `~a`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0120
